# wolf_camp.layout - frozen prospectors' bunkhouse (Wolf 359 b delve)
#
# The consortium's advance camp: a cabin of shipped timbers sunk into
# the ice, bunks and crates still stacked. The escrow cache sits at
# its heart, with the leftover security detail standing watch.
